# Terraform working directories and state
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Terragrunt generated files
**/.terragrunt-cache/
**/terragrunt_rendered.json
**/backend.tf
**/provider.tf
**/versions.tf
**/k8s_providers.tf

# Terragrunt 1.x copies the resolved lock file back out of
# .terragrunt-cache into the unit directory (copy_terraform_lock_file
# defaults to true) — not committed here, consistent with not committing
# any other Terragrunt-generated file in this repo.
**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Written and removed by CI's per-module validate step (see
# .github/workflows/terraform.yml); ignored here too as a safety net in
# case a run is interrupted before its cleanup step.
**/ci_versions.tf
